The synthetic multiplier sweep keeps 5 as the best average, with 13 close. Since 5 is already the best official generator so far, I’m going to keep it unless a separate idea has a stronger expected gain.
codex
I’m checking a mixed-generator lattice synthetically: half Korobov-5 and half Korobov-13 under one whitening transform. If it reduces generator-specific artifacts, it could be worth an official run.
